        "Description": "A contract has hired us to eliminate a group of pretenders working under the Kronstadt family. These individuals have been privately working on a dangerous project as a part of the rising orginisation known only as &quot;The Legitimate Businessman&apos;s Social Club&quot;.\r\rIf their project advances past it&apos;s infancy stages and is shown to the public it could spell the end for the Kronstadt empire. Only you can protect the sanctity of the Kronstadt household and take down these renegades.\r\rGood Luck 47.",
